  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p>The proposed development, by reason of scale and siting, would result in detrimental harm to the neighbouring property. Specifically, the proposed development would result in material loss of sunlight/daylight, and unacceptable overshadowing and overbearing impacts on 53 Dereham Road, therefore constituting unneighbourly development and contrary to: </p><p>- National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (DLUHC, 2023);<br>- Policy D4 of the London Plan (March 2021);<br>- Policies SP2, DMD1 and DMD5 of the London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s Local Plan (September 2024); <br>- The London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD (February 2012).</p>"
